Photorealistic vintage 1968 studio recording console secondary button plate, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, spanning 88 percent of image width and about one quarter of its height, isolated on a pure flat black background (#000000). Shape: long horizontal rectangular bar with softly rounded corners. Frame: aged dark antique bronze bezel with fine satin finish. Face: dark matte ebony wood panel with a thin recessed warm glowing amber filament line running horizontally through the middle. Minimalist vintage British studio hardware, crisp studio focus, symmetrical, flat black background. Absolutely no text, no symbols, no icons. Single object only, no watermark.
